{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/951479-nwod-1-0-are-there-rules-for-breaking-a-fall","id":951479,"title":"NWOD 1.0 are there rules for breaking a fall?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-08-15T21:07:49-07:00","id":951479,"title":"NWOD 1.0 are there rules for breaking a fall?","content":"Hello everyone, so im failing to find if there is any rule for breaking a fall.<br /> <br /> Im using NWoD 1.0 and i got a character with a high athletics and specialization in parkour that wants to jump from a 3rd floor and break his fall to reduce damage. Is there any rules for that i miss or are in a supplement?<br /> <br /> Thanks <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2179-lokiravenspeak","name":"LokiRavenSpeak","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1117"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-15T21:19:58-07:00","id":951481,"title":"","content":"Core rulebook, page 179:<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> The Storyteller may allow your character to try to break his fall by some means, perhaps by grabbing for awnings or twisting to strike soil rather than concrete. A single Dexterity + Athletics roll may be called for, with each success gained diminishing damage taken. There may be a limit to how much damage can be shaved, though \u2014 say, three. There\u2019s only so much that desperate flailing and grabbing can do when someone falls from a significant height. Efforts to slow one\u2019s fall are usually useless at terminal velocity. </div> </div> </div>I don't remember the 1e version of Parkour off the top of my head, but as I recall it was almost the same, if not identical to the 2e version, which at the second dot gives you one automatic success on the above mentioned Dexterity + Athletics roll, and adds your dots in Parkour to the threshold of damage that can be mitigated with said roll.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-17T13:33:38-07:00","id":952712,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Charlaquin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/951479-nwod-1-0-are-there-rules-for-breaking-a-fall?p=951481#post951481\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Core rulebook, page 179:<br /> <br /> <br /> I don't remember the 1e version of Parkour off the top of my head, but as I recall it was almost the same, if not identical to the 2e version, which at the second dot gives you one automatic success on the above mentioned Dexterity + Athletics roll, and adds your dots in Parkour to the threshold of damage that can be mitigated with said roll.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> thank you <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2179-lokiravenspeak","name":"LokiRavenSpeak","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1117"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}